-neon-index\">CSTD / TRACE 09</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-coordinate\">-33.8688 / 151.2093</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-signal\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-lock\">SIGNAL LOCKED</span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"underworld\" class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-stele\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-kicker\">UNDERWORLD ARCHIVE / FORGE 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-seal\"><i></i><i></i><b>V</b></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-oath\">TRIED BELOW · RETURNED WHOLE</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-cuts\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"astral\" class=\"cstd-deep-astral-compass\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-kicker\">ASTRAL JOURNAL / ROLL 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-die\"><i></i><b>20</b><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-route\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-oath\">CHOICE INKED · LEGACY CARRIED</span></div></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-content=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1540px] flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-16 pt-28 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:pb-20\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl\"><p data-cstd-page-hero-eyebrow=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">06 / KNOWLEDGE CONSTELLATION</p><h1 data-cstd-page-hero-title=\"true\" class=\"mt-6 text-balance text-[2.375rem] font-semibold leading-[0.94] tracking-[0] text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl md:leading-[0.9] lg:text-8xl xl:text-[7rem]\">Every project, note, and lab shares one technical constellation.</h1><p data-cstd-page-hero-summary=\"true\" class=\"mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#c3c9cb] md:text-xl md:leading-9\">Start from five system districts and travel through case evidence, field notes, reproducible labs, and learning moments. Every edge comes from a published content relationship.</p></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-scroll=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#748187]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-bounce text-[#f4d431]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->SCROLL / CONTINUE TRACE</div></div></header><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c] px-5 py-16 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1540px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.65fr_1.35fr] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">CSTD / GRAPH SCHEMA 01</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-5xl\">Knowledge is not a directory. It is a path you can continue.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#9aa4a8]\">Selecting a node changes the district visual, context, and related route. The graph contains only published material, and Ask CSTD 2.0 uses the same relationships for multi-source answers.</p></div><dl class=\"grid grid-cols-2 border-l border-t border-white/12 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"border-b border-r border-white/12 p-5\"><dt class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#68757b]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-orbit h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.341 6.484A10 10 0 0 1 10.266 21.85\"></path><path d=\"M3.659 17.516A10 10 0 0 1 13.74 2.152\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>PUBLISHED NODES</dt><dd class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold text-[#24e0ff]\">34</dd></div><div class=\"bor